PART 6 -- CONTROL 4, the arm I expect to be redundant: SLOT-AWARE weights
 the cancellation in PART 0 pairs two tableaux with the SAME m-sequence (4,3,2,1)
 but DIFFERENT cyclic-index sequences, so a slot-aware weight can separate them.
 generic slot-aware sum has 8 free symbols, 4 terms
 sum = g0_1**2*g3_3*g3_4 + g0_1*g0_2*g3_3*g3_4 + g0_1*g1_1*g2_1*g3_4 - g3_1*g3_2*g3_3*g3_4
